TLDR

Using an Alfa AC1900 WiFi Adapter to broadcast the hotspot:

| Component | Purpose | Buy |
|---|---|---|
| Alfa AC1900 WiFi Adapter | Long-range dual-band 802.11ac hotspot AP | No longer sold on Amazon |
| Alfa AC1200 WiFi Adapter (USB 3.0) (https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VEEBOPG?tag=dctm-20) | Closest current Alfa alternative | Amazon (https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VEEBOPG?tag=dctm-20) |
starting script: onstart.sh
Disable IPv6

sudo nano /etc/sysctl.conf
Install and Configure Pihole

curl -sSL https://install.pi-hole.net | PIHOLESKIPOS_CHECK=true sudo -E bash

setup the dhcp server to use 192.168.12.1 range.
